'''Mighty Rekon Korps''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.3 Update|Version 6.3]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]] gacha event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 8.4 Update|Version 8.4]] gains [[Omni Strike]], as well as increasing damage and range. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!|The Battle Cats Unite]], this unit was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

